            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3><span>Curiosity Café: Community Connections</span></h3>
<p>Dates: October 1, October 8 and October 15<br>Time: 1:30 pm to 3:30 pm&nbsp;<br>Ages: Older adults and curious minds of all ages<br>Cost: Adult - $7.78, plus tax; Senior (65+) - $7, plus tax<br><strong>*The admission fee is paid at the door. Registration is not required.&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>Take a stroll down memory lane with this engaging lecture series focused on the history of local neighbourhoods that have played a role in Nepean’s development, including Bells Corners, Hintonburg and Barrhaven. After the presentation, connect with fellow community members and share your own photo albums or memories highlighting the spotlighted neighbourhood during the group discussion. Light refreshments will be served.&nbsp;</p>
