<li>There is a small set of stairs between the upper level (main gallery) and the lower level (washrooms and community rooms) of the museum. A wheelchair lift also provides access between the two levels.</li>
<li>If you have questions or concerns regarding accessibility, contact the museum at 613-580-9638 or <a href="mailto:museums@ottawa.ca">museums@ottawa.ca</a>. Additional <a href="https://ottawa.ca/en/recreation-and-parks/facilities/place-listing/nepean-museum#section-b295afa6-ec8a-488e-af66-eae6bc4663c3">information regarding accessibility</a> is available on the museum webpage.&nbsp;</li>
