<li>Parental/guardian supervision is required (there is no additional cost for the adult accompanying the participating child). Infants younger than 2 years old may accompany the adult who is supervising a registered participant at no additional cost.</li>
<li>Please dress your child in clothes you are comfortable with getting messy.</li>
<li>Sessions with insufficient registration may be cancelled. If an alternative cannot be offered, a refund will be issued.</li>
<li>If you have questions or concerns regarding accessibility, contact the museum at 613-580-9638 or <a href="mailto:museums@ottawa.ca">museums@ottawa.ca</a>.  Additional <a href="https://ottawa.ca/en/recreation-and-parks/facilities/place-listing/nepean-museum#section-b295afa6-ec8a-488e-af66-eae6bc4663c3">information regarding accessibility</a> is available on the museum webpage.</li>
